  m_text: 'NETWORKING HANDBOOK


    STAR TOPOLOGY


    In a star topology, network
    devices connect through a central networking device.


    The network switch
    acts as the central connection point.


    Each computer connects directly to
    the switch rather than directly to another computer.


    Use the network switch
    to connect the four employee computers.


    Press ESC to close.'
